3721:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****                         and also HSI48 oscillator smooth trimming.
3722:Drivers/STM32U5xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32u5xx_hal_rcc_ex.c ****               (+++) Macro __HAL_RCC_CRS_RELOADVALUE_CALCULATE can be also used to calculate
